(919, 'Raid Finder: The Serpent Warren', 'Serpentine monstrosities now inhabit the ancient halls that entombed the victims of the Soulcoilers.', 'Join Raid', '', '', 6, 160506, 6, 2, 7966619, 3318, 0, 0, 32, 32, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 69497),
(918, 'Raid Finder: The Essence of Venom', 'Within The Chamber of Virulence, Vashnik the Malignant distills Ula\'tek\'s venoms into ever more lethal forms.', 'Join Raid', '', '', 6, 160459, 6, 2, 7966618, 3317, 0, 0, 33, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 69497);
