(35058, 'Overview', 'A mutated Zul\'jan unleashes his new power by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1282403|h[Coalescing Venom]|h|r within The Coiled Altar. He wields twin axes that |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1299680|h[Sever]|h|r players and destroy Coalesced Venom.\n\nUpon Zul\'jan\'s defeat, Malacrass joins the fray. Malacrass haunts players with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1285643|h[Dreadmarch]|h|r, creating Manifestations of Dread as it resolves. His casts of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1286620|h[Soul Sever]|h|r hurt players and destroy any Manifestations of Dread in its blast.\n\nUpon defeat, Malacrass begins a ritual of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1304032|h[Soulbinding]|h|r to revive Zul\'jan as his puppet, and claim what is rightfully his.', 2883, 1, 0, 35059, 35584, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, -1, 69497),
